1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,180
欢迎光临威廉斯堡餐厅
Welcome to the Williamsburg Diner.

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,560
这一顿饭将助你缩年减寿
Your lifespan just decreased by one meal.

3
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,100
你是要现在点餐
Would you like to order now

4
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,840
还是等那星系被毁灭后点
or after that galaxy is destroyed?

5
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:19,320
兄弟 我也能对你竖起一根手指
Oh, dude, I can hold up one finger, too,

6
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,980
相信我 绝对不是食指
and trust me; it won't be that one.

7
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,320
一号卡座归你了
Booth one is all yours.

8
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,660
如果我想跟一个
If I wanted to deal with a guy

9
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,260
不愿正视我存在的男人打交道
who won't even acknowledge my existence,

10
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,520
我早去找我爹了
I'd track down my father.

11
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:32,160
妆容得填补你个性上的不足
Makeup needs to complement the personality.

12
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,660
抱歉 没在听
Sorry, I wasn't listening.

13
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,300
眼后正要教我怎么拔眉毛
Mr. Eye Queen's about to show me how to pluck my eyebrows.

14
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:39,260
终于啊
Finally.

15
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,500
我都跟你说了一年了 你得拔拔眉毛
I've been telling you for a year you need to get plucked.

16
00:00:44,576 --> 00:00:47,698
上菜 半熟蛋
Pick up. Fried egg over easy.

17
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:50,140
修正 是全"硬"
Correction: make that over hard.

18
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,060
麦克斯 那是厄尔点的
Max, that's Earl's order.

19
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:53,520
帮忙一下吧
Can you?

20
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,660
我也能时间一到下班走人
You know, I could just check out

21
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:57,200
工作时浑水摸鱼啊
and phone in this job, too,

22
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,500
但我答应过自己
but I promised myself

23
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,460
长大后绝不当我妇科医生那样的人
I'd never grow up to be my gynecologist.

24
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,880
厄尔 我知道你一定还记得
Earl, I know you remember a time

25
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,540
人们彼此间会有眼神交流
where people still made eye contact

26
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:07,760
能看到我眼中鄙视的那段美好时光
and get the fact that I was totally dissing them.

27
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:10,140
真是太遗憾了 麦克斯
It's a damn shame, Max.

28
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,280
谢谢 厄尔
Thank you, Earl.

29
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,920
纽约大都会棒球队六局下半了还落后
The Mets are down in the bottom of the sixth.

30
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:16,380
连你都有智能手机了吗
Now you have one?

31
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,600
厄尔 三个月之前
Earl, three months ago,

32
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,500
你还以为T电信是饶舌歌手名呢
you thought T-Mobile was a rapper.

33
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:25,082
麦克斯 我想跟你说件事
Max, I want to talk to you.

34
00:01:25,082 --> 00:01:26,460
有何不可
Well, why not?

35
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:28,120
大家也都在听着亚洲产的
Everyone else is listening to something tiny

36
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:28,820
小东西说话
and made in Asia.

37
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,740
我刚听到了世上最好笑的笑话
I just heard the funniest joke.

38
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,960
有个男的开车上坡
A guy is driving a car up a hill

39
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,420
他看到路上有只猪
and he sees a pig in the road.

40
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,880
对了 我忘了一部分
Wait. Oh yes, I forgot.

41
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:39,960
当时正下着雨
It's raining.

42
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,420
当时正下着雨 路上有只猪
It's raining, and there is a pig.

43
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:43,320
我听着呢
I'm listening.

44
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:45,220
然后猪在车子上
And then the pig is in the car--

45
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,840
不对 猪在路上
no, the pig is in the road,

46
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,680
然后... 我马上回来
and--I'll be right back.

47
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,360
谢谢 欢迎再度光临
Thank you. Come again.

48
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:06,720
今晚下班后你想做什么
Hey, what do you want to do after work tonight?

49
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,880
我们可以一起去那家很潮只卖果汁的
Maybe we could go to that trendy new ice cream place

50
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,300
新冰激凌店啊
that only sells juice.

51
00:02:12,072 --> 00:02:13,740
不要 我太累了
Nah, I'm too tired.

52
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:15,420
我从03年开始就没坐下休息过
I've been on my feet since 2003.

53
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:19,580
我能要一个红丝绒...
Hi, can I get a red velvet--

54
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:21,900
天啊 麦克斯·布莱克[黑]
Oh, my God, Max Black?

55
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:24,040
我勒个去 贝姬·怀特[白]
Oh, my God, Becky White?

56
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,040
哇靠 我们都多久没见面了
Holy crap. How long has it been?

57
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:30,900
我上次上《批斗会》节目是哪年的事了
Let's see. When was I on "Intervention"?

58
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,940
你的头发又长回好看的那边了
Well, your hair's grown back on the right side,

59
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,200
所以我猜大概五年了吧
so I'd say five years.

60
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:37,700
你好 我叫卡洛琳
Hi, I'm Caroline.

61
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,420
我也想等麦克斯跟你介绍我
I'd wait for Max to introduce me,

62
00:02:39,420 --> 00:02:40,640
但她通常告诉别人
but she usually tells people

63
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:42,500
我是泰勒·斯威夫特弱智的表姐 兰蒂
I'm Taylor Swift's slow cousin Randi.

64
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:45,840
幸会
Nice to meet you.

65
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,880
麦克斯 我真没想到你还活着
Max, I did not think you would still be alive.

66
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:48,960
那我赌输你十块
I owe you $10.

67
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,040
贝姬是个女演员
Becky's an actress.

68
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,420
我才看了她出演电视剧《法律与秩序》
I just saw her in "Law and Order."

69
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:56,480
她演"跟被害人不太熟的熟食店员"超精彩
She owned "Deli worker who barely knew the victim."

70
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:59,900
对啊 我演过三次《法律与秩序》了
Yeah, I've done three "Law and Orders."

71
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,060
工作挺简单的
Pretty easy work.

72
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:02,540
我的尸首通常在某人后车厢被人发现
They usually find me in a trunk.

73
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,600
你们怎么认识的
How do you two know each other?

74
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:07,440
麦克斯跟我以前一起当过服务员
Max and I waited tables together.

75
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:09,660
其实通常就干站着跟喝醉酒
Well, mostly stood around and got drunk,

76
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,800
但还是薪水拿啊
but they paid us.

77
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:13,300
小店不错
Nice shop.

78
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,113
看来你们俩也一起做生意啊
Looks like you guys have a business together too.

79
00:03:15,113 --> 00:03:16,160
也有
Too?

80
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,080
你们也有过吗
You two too?

81
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:20,340
我们发明了只服务女性的优步
We invented an Uber just for women.

82
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:21,160
奶步
Boober.

83
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:24,260
其实应该挺有前景的
It would've been awesome,

84
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:26,780
不过我们没有软件 或车
except we didn't have an app...or a car.

85
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:29,400
别管这小蛋糕店了
Hey, forget about this cupcake.

86
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,700
我刚发薪水
I just got paid.

87
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:31,960
我请喝酒怎么样
How about drinks on me?

88
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,580
我说的请喝酒 是指一人一瓶蓝带啤酒
And by drinks, I mean one PBR each.

89
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,720
我也不介意喝一杯
I guess I could do drinks.

90
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,140
能麻烦你负责打烊吗 谢啦
Do you mind closing up? Thanks.

91
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:38,860
我出来前门找你
I'll meet you out front.

92
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,200
赞
Awesome.

93
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,040
很高兴认识你 布兰蒂
Nice meeting you, Brandi.

94
00:03:41,845 --> 00:03:43,751
是兰蒂
It's Randi!

95
00:03:46,734 --> 00:03:48,260
厄尔 还好吗[摇晃]
Hey, Earl, what's shaking?

96
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,659
麦克斯 我都要80岁了
Max, I'm pushing 80.

97
00:03:49,659 --> 00:03:53,338
你问"有啥不在摇晃"比较好答
The easier question is, "What isn't shaking?"

98
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:56,040
麦克斯 你昨晚上哪去了
Max, where were you last night?

99
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,720
害我得自己看《卡森·达利秀》
I had to watch "Carson Daly" alone and say,

100
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:01,060
然后跟自己吐槽"这节目还在播啊"
"This show's still on?" to no one.

101
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:03,700
我昨晚在贝姬家沙发上睡了
I crashed on Becky's couch,

102
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,560
而且 说了你也不敢信
of which-- you're not gonna believe this--

103
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,980
沙发居然是她新买的呢
she is the first owner.

104
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:12,500
你们昨晚玩得开心吗
So did you guys have fun last night,

105
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:14,520
还是已渐行渐远所以挺尴尬
or was it weird because you've grown apart?

106
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,580
这么说吧 我俩好到要去参加
Let's just say we're gonna be in not one,

107
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,340
两个婚礼了
but two wedding albums.

108
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,680
贝姬可会跳犹太婚礼圆圈舞呢
Becky can dance her some hora.

109
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:25,640
好玩
Fun.

110
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,760
你玩得好真是太好玩了
That's so fun that you had fun.

111
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:31,060
你这是闹哪样
Uh, what's happening here?

112
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,560
我以为我们是...
I guess I just thought we were...

113
00:04:35,180 --> 00:04:35,600
算了 不说了
Forget it.

114
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:36,820
千万别
Oh, no, please.

115
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,600
这就像在看一只鸟要撞上窗户的慢动作版
It's like watching a bird fly into a window in slow motion.

116
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,880
我还以为我们专属彼此
Well, you know, I thought we were exclusive,

117
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,200
我想不到更好的词了
for lack of a better word.

118
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,960
"一夫一妻"这样的词吗
What, like monogamous?

119
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,540
你觉得我们是一夫一妻般的友谊吗
You thought we were in a monogamous friendship?

120
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:53,300
我跟我该一夫一妻的人 都不是一夫一妻制了
I'm not even monogamous with the people I'm monogamous with.

121
00:04:54,506 --> 00:04:56,820
这有啥大不了啊
What is the big deal?

122
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:58,760
在我们成为朋友前 你也有朋友啊
You had friends before we were friends.

123
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,240
一帮有钱婊
Bunch of rich bitches.

124
00:05:01,567 --> 00:05:04,928
你们是在聊电视剧《老友记》吗
You guys talking about that show, "Friends"?

125
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:08,020
人们总说"为什么里面没有黑人老友"
People always say, "Why was there no black friend?"

126
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,600
因为任何一个脑子没病的黑人
Because no reasonable black man

127
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,240
都不会跟那帮人当朋友
would hang out with those people.

128
00:05:14,740 --> 00:05:16,640
他等着说出这段话
He's been waiting to get that off his chest

129
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,760
大概等了20年了吧
since the mid-'90s.

130
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,540
你知道我刚意识到什么吗
You know what I just realized?

131
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:23,720
我还没有试过以穷人身份跟人交朋友
I've never tried to make friends as a not-rich person.

132
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,860
你交了我这个朋友啊
You made friends with me.

133
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,360
虽然我被强迫中奖 但也算数啊
Against my will, but still.

134
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:29,460
你猜我要干嘛
Guess what I'm doing?

135
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:32,520
给我上求职网站看人履历的动力吗
Motivating me to look at resumes on monster.com?

136
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:35,740
我现在要去跟人交朋友
I'm gonna make a friend right now.

137
00:05:35,900 --> 00:05:38,300
我服务区有一个头发称得上干净的姑娘
There's a girl in my section with clean-ish looking hair.

138
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,321
说到"毛发" 上菜
Speaking of hair, pick up.

139
00:05:41,321 --> 00:05:42,691
科布沙拉
Cobb salad.

140
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:46,500
麦克斯 我这个交友笑容如何
Max, how's this for my friend-making smile?

141
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:51,000
你的牙齿总数是不是比我多啊
Do you have more teeth than me?

142
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:57,620
这是您的沙拉 调味料分开放了
Here's you salad. Dressing on the side.

143
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:00,300
我自己也是"调分放"那种女孩
I'm sort of a "DOS" gal myself.

144
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:01,760
好的
Okay.

145
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:03,700
谢谢
Thanks.

146
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:07,180
或许我们哪天应该一起把沙拉言欢
Maybe we should, I don't know, grab a couple salads sometime.

147
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:09,020
点评网特别说了
The Yelp review specifically said

148
00:06:09,020 --> 00:06:10,100
服务员绝对不会鸟我
I would be ignored by the waitstaff.

149
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,540
你的沙拉里有"毛"
There's hair in your salad.

150
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:16,100
不好意思
Excuse me.

151
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,960
这里的水就是那个颜色
The water's supposed to be that color.

152
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:19,660
不 不是的
No, no.

153
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:21,960
我觉得你这么勇敢很酷
I just think it's cool how brave you were

154
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,420
敢于跟陌生人交朋友
to put yourself out there like that.

155
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:26,220
我上一次被说酷 还是拥有一张黑卡
I haven't been called cool since I had a black card

156
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:28,635
与3/4个岛的时候呢
and owned 3/4 of an island.

157
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:30,460
我叫瑞秋 这位是凯西
I'm Rachel. This is Kathy.

158
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:31,820
我叫卡洛琳
I'm Caroline,

159
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:33,760
你们绝对想不到我有多勇敢
and you have no idea how brave I am.

160
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:35,040
你们应该看看我洗澡的地方
You should see where I shower.

161
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,140
她应该来参加我们的派对
She should come to our party.

162
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,900
她刚搬来威廉斯堡
She just moved to Williamsburg,

163
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:41,120
我们明天打算举办一个派对
and we're having a party tomorrow.

164
00:06:41,220 --> 00:06:42,820
-你应该一起来 -其实呢
- You should come. - Oh, you know what?

165
00:06:42,820 --> 00:06:46,380
我明晚有点忙 因为我要去参加你的派对
I'm busy tomorrow night because I'm going to your party!

166
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,780
那些搞播客的人都没她这么渴求认同
I've seen people with podcasts less desperate for approval.

167
00:06:58,180 --> 00:07:00,740
麦克斯 我昨晚玩得超开心
Max, I had the most amazing night.

168
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,560
我也是 贝姬刚走
Me too. Becky just left.

169
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:03,880
她明天得早起
She has to get up early tomorrow.

170
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:06,260
不是要炫耀 但她要在电视剧《警察世家》中
Not to brag, but she's playing a dead hooker

171
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:07,120
演死掉的妓女
on "Blue Bloods."

172
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,200
所以她来这里做调查学习吗
Oh, so she came here for research.

173
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:13,100
我的新朋友们瑞秋与凯西
Anyways, my new friends Rachel and Kathy

174
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:16,660
以及派对上的所有人都好温暖与正能量
and everybody there were so warm and positive.

175
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,980
跟一群发愤图强并努力向前的人相处
It was so refreshing to be around people

