我知道我在高潮门前好一阵子才成功进去
I know I was almost there for quite some time.

360
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,200
麦克斯 卡洛琳 你们俩在外面干嘛
Max, Caroline, what are you doing out here?

361
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:37,620
我们迫切地等待
We were just anxiously awaiting

362
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:38,760
您的临幸
intercourse with you.

363
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,000
真的吗
Really?

364
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:43,500
因为除非那袋子装的全是情趣用具
'Cause unless that bag's full of marital aids,

365
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,100
否则你们看起来是想溜走
it looks like you're trying to sneak out.

366
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:47,760
听着 伊莱恩
Look, Elaine,

367
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:50,040
这一切我很难接受 无意冒犯
this is all a lot, and no offense,

368
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:51,680
但我今年的第一炮
but you can't be the first person

369
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:52,900
对象不能是你
I have sex with this year.

370
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:57,280
我明白你们俩都觉得有点不知所措
I understand that you're both feeling a little overwhelmed,

371
00:15:57,280 --> 00:16:00,320
但在你们走之前 我们何不以集体的形式
but before you go, why don't we discuss this as a group

372
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,320
疗愈般地讨论一下
in a healing way?

373
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:03,200
好的 尤金 待着别动
All right, Eugene, stay where you are.

374
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:04,380
你需要休息
You need some rest.

375
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,660
或许需要补充蛋白质
Maybe a little protein.

376
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:14,380
不如我们直接走吧
So you know what? We're just gonna go.

377
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:15,880
你可以跟门口那人说
You can tell that guy at the door

378
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:17,800
让他让开 好让我们...
he can just step aside so we can,

379
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:19,220
你懂的 飞奔离开
you know, start running.

380
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:22,940
卡洛琳 你们随时都可以走
Caroline, you are free to go at any time.

381
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:24,300
那我们可以现在走吗
So we can go right now?

382
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:24,840
不行
No.

383
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:28,280
卡洛琳 你何不坐这边 瑞秋
Caroline, why don't you sit here, and Rachel,

384
00:16:28,620 --> 00:16:30,140
把麦克斯带到锣那边
bring Max over by the gong.

385
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:34,460
Siri 记得提醒我申请锣烟枪[音似]的专利
Siri, remind me to patent a gong bong.

386
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,900
顺便提醒我弄个有Siri的手机
Also remind me to get a phone with Siri.

387
00:16:39,900 --> 00:16:43,500
我知道今晚还有人没能跟我上床
Now, I know some of you have not yet laid with me tonight...

388
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:47,700
但我注意到
But it's come to my attention

389
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:49,540
我们中间有一位NN
that we have an N.N. in our midst.

390
00:16:49,976 --> 00:16:51,712
-什么 -是谁
- What? - Who?

391
00:16:51,712 --> 00:16:53,520
问一下 什么是NN
Quick Q on the N.N.

392
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:56,400
这个N是代表玉米脆片的意思吗
Do either of those Ns stand for nachos?

393
00:16:58,367 --> 00:17:00,980
NN代表的是"消极的奈利"
N.N. stands for Negative Nelly.

394
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:03,080
"消极的南希"已经被另一个抢注了
Negative Nancy was already trademarked

395
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:05,960
而那个团体的领导是我的前夫 南希
by another group run by my ex-husband, Nancy.

396
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:11,840
卡洛琳 你知道这个NN可能会是谁人吗
Caroline, do you have any idea who this N.N. could be?

397
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:15,860
你是要问"谁"吗 我不知道
I believe it's "whom" And no, I don't.

398
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:19,680
卡洛琳 你现在过着你想要的人生吗
Caroline, are you where you want to be in life?

399
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:20,960
差了十万八千里
Oh, God, no.

400
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:26,220
你会觉得是因为某人在扯你后腿吗
And would you say there's someone holding you back?

401
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,880
我的确是觉得
Well, I do feel like

402
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:31,260
每天听女演员艾米·舒默的事
hearing about Amy Schumer every day

403
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:32,920
有点让我感到无力
makes me feel a little "less than."

404
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:36,980
卡洛琳 在这间屋子里的某人
Caroline, is there someone in this room

405
00:17:36,980 --> 00:17:39,960
就是你带来的那位棕发人士
who you brought with brown hair

406
00:17:40,970 --> 00:17:43,460
她的消极奈利气息
whose Negative Nelly-ness

407
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:47,720
是不是阻挡了你的前路而你不自知呢
is blocking you in ways you don't even realize?

408
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:50,340
等等
Wait a minute.

409
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:54,280
我怎么开始感觉到是在说我
I'm starting to think this is about me.

410
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:58,740
经过短短几小时与麦克斯的相处
Just having spent a few short hours with Max

411
00:17:58,740 --> 00:18:00,940
并录下了你们所有的对话
and recording all your conversations...

412
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,240
很显然
It's pretty clear

413
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,820
她在你的成功道路上
that she is undermining your path to success

414
00:18:06,820 --> 00:18:08,900
用她的俏皮话与双关语在搞破坏
with her wisecracks and wordplay.

415
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:10,500
听我说
Look.

416
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:13,680
麦克斯看起来可能很消极 她也的确是
Max might seem negative, because she is,

417
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:16,820
但如果你的人生像她一般 你也会消极
but you would be, too, if you were her.

418
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:19,240
她这一生被人忽视 拒之门外
She's been neglected, rejected,

419
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,280
被人击倒 吐口水
knocked down, and spat on.

420
00:18:21,380 --> 00:18:22,780
其中某些是相互的
Some of that was consensual.

421
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:25,960
你看 这就很正面积极啊
See? That was positive.

422
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:30,260
所以你愿意放弃这一切潜在人脉
So you will give up all these potential connections

423
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:31,240
就为了她一人吗
just for her?

424
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:34,160
卡洛琳 我曾经住在泽西城
Caroline, I used to live in Jersey City,

425
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:37,660
而我现在搬到新泽西更好的地区了呢
and now I live in a better part of New Jersey.

426
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:42,040
伊莱恩 我本以为我需要交些新朋友
Elaine, I thought I needed to make new friends,

427
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:43,380
所以我才沦落到这里
and that's how I wound up here,

428
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:46,100
但原来 我只需要麦克斯一人
but turns out all I needed was Max.

429
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:47,880
我愿意在她身上赌一把
I'll take my chances with her.

430
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:49,800
天大的错误啊
Huge mistake.

431
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:50,380
天大
Huge.

432
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:53,760
那两位走吧
Well, then you're free to go.

433
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,480
把账结了就行了
Just need to settle up your bill.

434
00:18:55,900 --> 00:18:58,020
这周末派对只对朋友免费
This weekend is only free for friends.

435
00:18:58,420 --> 00:18:59,060
瑞秋
Rachel.

436
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:03,060
我吃了一只价值700块的虾吗
I ate $700 worth of shrimp?

437
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:06,480
感觉的确是差不多这个数
That seems about right.

438
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:09,380
我们不能付这个钱
We can't pay that.

439
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:11,800
有船需要我们清理
Is there a ship we can scrub?

440
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:14,440
还是同志名人需要形婚的吗
Or a gay celebrity we can marry?

441
00:19:16,100 --> 00:19:17,740
别担心 我来跟伊莱恩处理
Don't worry. I'll settle up with Elaine.

442
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:21,920
你收上天恩赐的信用卡吗
Do you accept nature's credit card?

443
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:25,600
滚出去
Get out.

444
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:34,080
真不敢相信我唯一能交到朋友的方法
I can't believe the only way I can make a friend

445
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,220
是加入邪教
is to join a cult.

446
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:37,980
你跟我交了朋友啊 我不是邪教中人
Well, you made friends with me, and I'm not in a cult...

447
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:38,940
已金盆洗手
anymore.

448
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:43,520
麦克斯 有一天我们也能像你跟贝姬那样吗
Max, are you and I gonna be like you and Becky someday?

449
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:46,240
除非我们其中一人能变得超级超级
Not unless one of us gets really, really,

450
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:48,000
是变得比现在酷炫超级多才行
I mean, so much cooler.

451
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:49,980
我是认真的
I'm serious.

452
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:53,480
我会不会就只是你的某个服务员同事
Am I gonna be just some waitress you used to know?

453
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,860
这样我会心碎的
'Cause that would kill me.

454
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:57,360
我从来不这样想你
I don't think of you that way at all.

455
00:19:58,600 --> 00:19:59,640
我是指 你不够格当服务员
I mean as a waitress.

456
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:01,940
的确 我跟贝姬曾经是同事
Look, yes, Becky and I worked together,

457
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:03,940
也的确 我们也曾一起有过一个创业梦想
and yes, we had kind of a business dream, too,

458
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:06,220
但你和我所拥有的远远不止如此
but you and I have so much more than that.

459
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:08,740
你跟我马上就要死在森林里了
You and I are about to die in the woods.

460
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:09,240
你看
Look.

461
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:11,600
我们绝对要上这台车
We are getting in that car

462
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:13,600
哪怕车主其中一只手是钩子
even if this guy has a hook for a hand.

463
00:20:15,660 --> 00:20:16,104
还好咩
Wazzup?

464
00:20:16,104 --> 00:20:18,620
姑娘们
Hey, girls.

465
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:20,440
我从没想过大晚上在阴暗的马路上
I never thought I'd be happy to see Oleg

466
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:21,840
见到奥列格会这么开心
on a dark road at night.

467
00:20:22,580 --> 00:20:24,720
苏菲 你们俩在这里干嘛呢
Sophie, what are you guys doing here?

468
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:27,620
麦克斯把所在位置发给我了
Oh, well, Max texted me her location.

469
00:20:27,860 --> 00:20:29,780
说如果她没有回复消息
Said if I didn't hear back from her,

470
00:20:29,780 --> 00:20:32,840
就表示你们被邪教挟持 得来救你们
you'd been abducted by the cult and to come rescue you.

471
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,240
我也曾入过魔教
I was in a cult once.

472
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:36,640
入过"雅芳"的魔
It's called Avon.

473
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:44,160
所以你早早就确定我交不到普通朋友
So you were so certain I couldn't make a normal friend

474
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,660
所以先安排好逃生计划吗
you had an escape plan?

475
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:48,000
有时候我"消极有好报"啊
Hey, sometimes my negativity pays off.

476
00:20:48,420 --> 00:20:49,940
而有时候则会害我被关进百货拘留所
Sometimes it gets me in mall jail.
